Description: wait for the SSC service to appear on the QRTR bus
 The QRTR node lookup for the SSC service is single-shot, but the DSP side
 only publishes that service a few seconds into the boot. On a no-initramfs
 direct-boot system iio-sensor-proxy is started before that, fails the lookup
 and then exits; the sensors stay invisible until something restarts it.
 .
 Retry the lookup for a few seconds, and do not delay at all when the service
 is already there.
Origin: sheng_fedora_packages/libssc/wait_for_qmi_service.patch
Forwarded: no
